# Garruk, Veiled Butcher (cast turn 1 with Black Lotus and two Mox Jets): on turn 3 the +2 gives Bot2's Questing Beast (4/4,
# haste, cast turn 2) -4/-1 until Bot1's next turn, so it is a 0/3 and its attack on turn 4 deals no damage (Bot1 stays at 20).
# On turn 5 Bot1's turn has begun and the Beast is a 4/4 again. The second +2 that turn takes no target ("up to one").
# Loyalty 5 + 2 + 2 = 9.

